 msgstr "Comprobando"
 
 #: addons/skin.estuary/xml/DialogPlayerProcessInfo.xml
-#. Hades, system page of the player information, VRR of a video at its own rate: the refresh of the output follows the video (measured); the display may show the refresh rate of the mode in its own information
+#. Hades, system page of the player information, VRR of a video at its own rate: the refresh of the output follows the video (measured); the TV or monitor may say another refresh rate, that of the mode, in its own information (one line)
